by brainlessness, but have life saving. I don't really know why did
the Dev. Team sigle out this cause of death as being 'unrecoverable'
by life saving - but that's how it is... Maybe to make mind flayers
a bit more challenging - otherwise they would be an easy source of
intelligence...

